<title>POLAND: Exbud signs PLN 29.5 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud signs PLN 29.5 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud SA signed a 29.5-million-zloty contract for building a waste treatment plant facility in the south eastern city of Rzeszow, Exbud said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the work would be carried out by June 30, 1999.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
